qtee-tas for Debian
====================

This package installs proprietary Qualcomm Trusted Application (TA) binary
blobs required by the QTEE (Qualcomm Trusted Execution Environment) firmware
stack.

Installed files
----------------

The TA blobs are installed to:

  /usr/lib/qtee-tas/

where they are loaded at runtime by the TEE supplicant or related firmware
services. No configuration is required or provided by this package.

Architecture
------------

This package is built only for arm64, matching the platforms on which the
Qualcomm QTEE firmware stack is used.
